flowchart LR
    TX[Signed UTXO Spend<br/>~3,950 bytes] --> G1
    
    G1{Gate 1<br/>Mempool<br/>Conflict Tag} -->|Conflict| X1[❌ Rejected<br/>Priority too low]
    G1 -->|No Conflict| G2
    
    G2{Gate 2<br/>State<br/>UtxoSet::contains} -->|Missing| X2[❌ Rejected<br/>Transaction is outdated]
    G2 -->|Exists| G3
    
    G3{Gate 3<br/>Runtime<br/>lock == hash pk} -->|Mismatch| X3[❌ Rejected<br/>LockMismatch]
    G3 -->|Match| G4
    
    G4{Gate 4<br/>Crypto<br/>ML-DSA-44 verify} -->|Invalid| X4[❌ Rejected<br/>SignatureVerificationFailed]
    G4 -->|Valid| OK[✅ Included in block<br/>~6 seconds]

    style G1 fill:#0d1117,stroke:#58a6ff,stroke-width:2px,color:#e6edf3
    style G2 fill:#0d1117,stroke:#58a6ff,stroke-width:2px,color:#e6edf3
